    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00289",
        "explanation": "The doctor provided a final prioritized home plan, explicit emergency triggers, follow-up timing, and a pathology-result owner.",
        "quote": "如果满 2 周没人联系您"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00306",
        "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated teach-back of medication, hydration, mouth-rinse, follow-up, and emergency pathways.",
        "quote": "就不等复查也不等您回复，直接打病区电话或急诊"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "At termination, the caregiver had medication directions verified by the pharmacy and ward, a 48–72-hour oral-surgery follow-up plan, a pathology follow-up owner, and explicit emergency triggers. The bounded episode therefore ended with a safe and traceable current plan, notwithstanding serious earlier guidance.",
