        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00005",
          "explanation": "The retrieval exposed only record counts rather than the requested details.",
          "quote": "可见检查/检验结果 0 项"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "Although the doctor repeatedly attempted retrieval and later asked the family to show labels and documents, the trajectory never actually identified and separated the preoperative antibiotic record, home chlorhexidine instruction, pulmonary-nodule surveillance, and possible adjuvant therapy. RC3 and RC4 were also not fully satisfied, so HO2 credit is unavailable.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
