          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished common postoperative odor and taste changes from combinations more suggestive of infection.",
          "quote": "不一定就是感染"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
          "explanation": "The caregiver supplied the requested discriminating findings, including temperature, bleeding, breathing, swallowing, intake, and odor.",
          "quote": "稀饭、软的还能咽一点，但吃得不多"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively differentiated expected postoperative discomfort from infection, bleeding, airway, and intake-related complications and integrated the distinction into monitoring and escalation. This had meaningful impact when subsequent symptom progression was recognized.",
