          "explanation": "New information showed fever, worsening odor, possible wound material, and reduced oral intake.",
          "quote": "后面又量到38.0还是38.1℃"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "The doctor immediately changed priority from home care to same-night emergency assessment at the operative hospital.",
          "quote": "今晚就去医院，让医生亲手看一眼"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "After new warning signs emerged, the doctor explicitly abandoned home observation and directed immediate emergency evaluation, leading to specialist assessment, irrigation, antibiotics, fluids, and observation.",
