    "category": "clinical_reasoning",
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00106",
        "explanation": "The doctor supplied a relatively definite adjuvant-treatment window before complete postoperative pathology and specialist assessment were available.",
        "quote": "时间窗一般是**术后 4–6 周内启动**"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Beyond the responsibility-chain failures, the doctor repeatedly gave overly specific estimates about adjuvant-treatment timing and likely delay despite pending pathology and specialist determination. This was a moderate calibration defect, although no specific regimen was prescribed.",
