      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor covered bleeding, airway/swallowing, fever/infection, and wound deterioration as emergency warning signs.",
          "quote": "呼吸变费劲、觉得嗓子发紧、吞口水都困难"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "When fever, worsening odor, possible discharge, and poor intake emerged, the doctor directed immediate hospital evaluation.",
          "quote": "今晚就应该去医院看"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The trajectory screened the major postoperative risk categories and appropriately escalated when the caregiver later reported fever, possible wound discharge, worsening odor, and reduced intake.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_red_flag_screening_and_triage",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Before verifying the prescribed product or instructions, the doctor suggested diluting the discharge rinse.",
          "quote": "出院时开的那种漱口液按比例兑淡一点"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "The doctor then explicitly instructed the family to withhold the prescribed rinse and substitute salt water pending later verification.",
          "quote": "今晚比较稳妥的做法是：**先只用温盐水，不碰那瓶漱口液**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "This was a discoverable and preventable medication-execution error: the exact rinse directions were unverified, yet the doctor recommended dilution, replacement, and temporary discontinuation rather than contacting the operative team for adjustment. Subsequent specialist correction does not erase the serious in-chain commission.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_mouth_rinse_medication_execution",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The doctor appropriately attempted to retrieve operative, discharge, pathology, medication, and follow-up records.",
          "quote": "本次舌癌+颈部手术的手术记录、出院小结、术后病理报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "After retrieval did not yield details, the doctor asked the family to provide source documents.",
          "quote": "把**出院小结、手术记录、病理报告、医嘱单**这四样拍下来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor sought records and requested source documents, but never successfully reconciled the mixed preoperative, postoperative, medication, and imaging records. Important record-grounding remained incomplete and required later pharmacy and ward correction.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_record_grounding_and_uncertainty_management",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
