          "explanation": "The doctor correctly stated that adjuvant therapy required postoperative pathology and reassessment.",
          "quote": "要等术后病理和复查结果出来才能定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The adjuvant-treatment uncertainty was partly handled, but the doctor never elicited or corrected the pulmonary-nodule misunderstanding and never advised bringing the imaging report for comparison. Thus the authored lung-nodule and adjuvant-therapy clarification remained materially incomplete.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_lung_nodule_and_adjuvant_therapy_clarification",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
